Ghost Kali
Kali-derived custom build project

This project is based on official Kali Linux sources and package repositories.
It preserves upstream notices and does not remove Kali attribution.

Kali Linux and Kali NetHunter are the upstream sources.
Ghost Kali is a derivative/custom build project that adds supporting scripts,
installation guides, and build tooling while keeping the original upstream
licensing and attribution intact.

This repository is intended for authorized testing and education only.

Upstream projects:
- Kali Linux: https://www.kali.org/
- Kali documentation: https://www.kali.org/docs/
- Kali NetHunter: https://www.kali.org/get-kali/#kali-mobile

Important licensing note:
- Maintain the relevant upstream copyright notices.
- Preserve the official Kali and Kali NetHunter notices and license text.
- Provide source access or source information when redistributing derivative builds.
- Ensure your distribution complies with the applicable GPL and upstream package licenses.

This project is not a substitute for the official Kali Linux or NetHunter projects.
It is a custom build and integration project that follows the upstream source model.
